imal blocks to add , then unleash their abilities at the perfect moment!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973490/extras/88fcb22700a1eb9f404154b7fda907e5.poster.avif?t=1762252387\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973490/extras/88fcb22700a1eb9f404154b7fda907e5.webm?t=1762252387\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973490/extras/88fcb22700a1eb9f404154b7fda907e5.mp4?t=1762252387\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are five types of animals to choose from, guess what they can do?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973490/extras/b1eba247ac2c34ffb8d21892c111d6a5.poster.avif?t=1762252387\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973490/extras/b1eba247ac2c34ffb8d21892c111d6a5.webm?t=1762252387\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973490/extras/b1eba247ac2c34ffb8d21892c111d6a5.mp4?t=1762252387\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973490/extras/ae58486964f202c35ee1b8971837ef56.poster.avif?t=1762252387\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973490/extras/ae58486964f202c35ee1b8971837ef56.webm?t=1762252387\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973490/extras/ae58486964f202c35ee1b8971837ef56.mp4?t=1762252387\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973490/extras/9016e6851455862e9c9ce94fe1dca75b.poster.avif?t=1762252387\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973490/extras/9016e6851455862e9c9ce94fe1dca75b.webm?t=1762252387\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973490/extras/9016e6851455862e9c9ce94fe1dca75b.mp4?t=1762252387\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973490/extras/0c7c979ccf78a6c13da097855d5b490a.poster.avif?t=1762252387\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973490/extras/0c7c979ccf78a6c13da097855d5b490a.webm?t=1762252387\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973490/extras/0c7c979ccf78a6c13da097855d5b490a.mp4?t=1762252387\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973490/extras/21233782594b22cf3296c50dc6fcd208.poster.avif?t=1762252387\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973490/extras/2