52387\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973490/extras/b1cac4fed7ad63c55c3a0cc035393769.webm?t=1762252387\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973490/extras/b1cac4fed7ad63c55c3a0cc035393769.mp4?t=1762252387\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roguelite \u00d7 Stacking:</strong> Draft an Animal Block after every time clearing three line and master the timing of your plays.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Many Animal Powers:</strong> Different animals, different abilities\u2014find the build that fits your style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shop &amp; Currency:</strong> Spend cleared blocks to buy more usable standard pieces; stash them for life-saving turns.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Stage Obstacles:</strong> Unlock new rules as you climb and overcome fresh challenges with your crew.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Planned Updates</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More levels, more animals (of course!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Score ranking (challenge your limits!!!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Used Animal Encyclopedia (learn more about your partners)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Difficulty options (think the original isn\u2019t hard enough?)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secret shop (buy some weird stuff\u2026 really weird)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com