o></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each stage introduces different <strong>obstacles</strong>\u2014team up with your animal buddies and take on the challenge!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973490/extras/b1cac4fed7ad63c55c3a0cc035393769.poster.avif?t=1762252387\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973490/extras/b1cac4fed7ad63c55c3a0cc035393769.webm?t=1762252387\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973490/extras/b1cac4fed7ad63c55c3a0cc035393769.mp4?t=1762252387\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roguelite \u00d7 Stacking:</strong> Draft an Animal Block after every time clearing three line and master the timing of your plays.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Many Animal Powers:</strong> Different animals, different abilities\u2014find the build that fits your style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shop &amp; Currency:</strong> Spend cleared blocks to buy more usable standard pieces; stash them for life-saving turns.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Stage Obstacles:</strong> Unlock new rules as you climb and overcome fresh challenges with your crew.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Planned Updates</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More levels, more animals (of course!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Score ranking (challenge your limits!!!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Used Animal Encyclopedia (learn more about your partners)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Difficulty options (think the original isn\u2019t hard enough?)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secret shop (buy some weird stuff\u2026 really weird)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Lao"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3963980","name":"Why Elephant Sit On Chair?"},"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973490/267801e23d29afa6ddf864fae765700e6c156639/header.jpg?t=1762252387","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Why Elephant Sit On Chair?","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":[],"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Lao"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"l","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"0","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":false,"date":"4 Nov, 2025"},"required_age":0,"short_description":"Why Elephant Sit On Chair? is a game that combines block-clearing with light roguelite elements. Team up with your animal block companions to face all kinds of unexpected challenges. every run is full of surprises! Just a tip: don\u2019t step on their tails.","steam_appid":3973490,"support_info":{"email":"12weiwei123@gmail.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese","type":"demo","website":null}